    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 10,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "Hold still."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 7,
        "line": 721,
        "text": "I’m sorry about Maryanne. Her poor family... I don't want to feel guilty. I think our duty is to live as well as we can. It gives reason to the sacrifices that men like Parcher and you made. A lot of Americans died so we could make a life here. It would be a sin if we didn't."
      }
